    body: 'If you have read a question twice and still do not see a clear path, make your best guess and move on - once submitted, answers cannot be changed. A question you cannot crack in 30 seconds is costing you a question you could answer in 20. Unanswered questions and wrong answers score the same, so a considered guess always beats leaving it blank.',
