      'Sample summaries by background',
      '<p><strong>Consulting - client management:</strong> Senior Manager owning full P&amp;L for three client accounts across European grocery retail, worth £2.4M in annual fees. Leads a team of 8 across 6 concurrent workstreams and lifted average client margin by 3% in the last year alone.</p><p><strong>Career pivot into tech:</strong> Talent Acquisition specialist with 3+ years\' experience placing technical hires, now pivoting into a tech-focused role of her own - a shift built on a Computer Science degree from Durham and a postgraduate diploma from Warwick, including a specialist module in applied cybersecurity.</p><p><strong>Consulting - sector strategist:</strong> Consumer-products strategist promoted to Director within 4 years, spanning both consulting and industry. Owns digital experience, commercial strategy and innovation agendas across categories, with a track record of turning plans into double-digit revenue impact.</p><p><strong>Industry - operations pivot:</strong> Engineering leader who scaled production at a manufacturing SME for 4 years, now targeting an individual-contributor move. Ran a team of 40+ through 4 direct reports, delivered £750K in monthly revenue, and cut overtime costs by £1,500 a month through leaner batch scheduling.</p>'
